      "text": "Hive Home — iteration 3 · light",
      "w": 240,
      "x": 0,
      "y": 1450
    },
    "how": {
      "fill": "purple",
      "text": "Press Play on Home. A group with four apps or fewer: tap an icon to open that app. More than four: the three most used apps stay big (opens in the last 30 days, recent ones weigh more), the rest shrink into the fourth spot — tap it to open the group as a folder over a blurred Home (Creative); tap outside the folder to close it. Customize (Dock, right) → move, pin, hide, rename, reorder, add groups. Gear → Settings.\n\nAccent: teal #2DD4BF (fills), #0F766E for teal text on light. Tinted icons, one square size 169 × 169 (13 · 65 · 13 · 65 · 13), Dock for pinned (max 4).",
      "w": 300,
      "x": 3290,
      "y": 0
    },
    "scroll": {
      "fill": "teal",
      "text": "Scrolling: Today swipes sideways and snaps per card (dots are tappable). The header stays put; Today and the groups slide under it and fade, and slide under the Dock at the bottom. The glow stays fixed like a wallpaper.",
      "w": 300,
      "x": 3290,
      "y": 420
    },
    "large": {
      "fill": "orange",
      "text": "Largest text size: Today widgets become full-width (one per swipe), the title may wrap to two lines, group names grow. Group cards stay square — they hold no text.",
      "w": 300,
      "x": 3290,
      "y": 760
    }
  },
